  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Access to Health Fund phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The access to Health fund focuses on the most under-served populations, and under a rights-based approach, brings improved health outcomes for vulnerable populations in conflict-affected areas and increased social cohesion. One aim of the fund is to extend access to sexual and reproductive health services and information, and to ensure the realization of related rights and autonomy for vulnerable populations, with a particular focus on youth and people from hard-to-reach areas.</narrative>
  </description>
